      "created_at": "2015-04-07T21:43:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Will there be any copies heading to the UK? I've noticed very few suplliers have any of the DHMG products listed at all. Also will Diner be shipping with it? That sounds like an intriguing little title too (and worth a gamble at probably about £8)</p>",
